      "text": "God said, Let us make man in our image, Gen. 1:26 (Alma 22:12; Ether 3:15; D&C 20:18; Moses 2:26; Abr. 4:26–27). Lord God formed man of the dust of the ground, Gen. 2:7 (D&C 77:12; Moses 3:7). the rib … taken from man, made he a woman, Gen. 2:22 (Abr. 5:17). out of it wast thou taken: for dust thou art, Gen. 3:19. in the likeness of God made he him, Gen. 5:1. them that dwell in houses of clay, whose foundation is in the dust, Job 4:19. man shall turn again unto dust, Job 34:15. dust return to the earth as it was, Eccl. 12:7. I have created him for my glory, I have formed him, Isa. 43:7. made the earth, and created man upon it, Isa. 45:12. hath not one God created us, Mal. 2:10.",
